<title>USA: Dakota Mining Corp Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Dakota Mining Corp Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.27     loss	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net loss		   9,446     loss	 1,147</p>
<p> Revs			 9,065		    3,188</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.45     loss	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net loss		  13,599     loss	 4,097</p>
<p> Revs			15,866		    6,636</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 net loss includes a non-recurring charge of $7.92 million to reduce the company's carrying value of its investment in the Golden Reward mine to estimated salvage value.</p>
<p>First nine months results include the accrual of about $1.7 million of estimated future reclamation and shutdown costs related to the Golden Reward mine.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
